  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9bAr2oL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"949\" height=\"251\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252ffTzK9SP\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/648382392230215702?color=208fc6&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=1b74b6&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord\" width=\"145\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ItsBlackGear\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=ItsBlackGear&amp;color=208fc6&amp;labelColor=1b74b6&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=DDE4EF\" alt=\"\" width=\"157\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/blackgear\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?label=&amp;color=208fc6&amp;labelColor=1b74b6&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Patreon&amp;logoColor=white&amp;url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api/?username=blackgear&amp;type=patrons\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"28\"></a><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6H8YGoX.png\" width=\"1131\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Fabric 还是 Quilt？</strong></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">你需要安装 Fabric API</h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires_Fabric_API-white?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=1b74b6&amp;color=208fc6\" alt=\"\" width=\"176\" height=\"28\"></a></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6H8YGoX.png\" width=\"1131\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">🚀 <strong>Platform</strong> 是一个基于 Architectury 的跨平台库模组，可同时访问 Forge 和 Fabric API。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><strong>功能特性：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">模组实例构建器</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">内置注册表构建器</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">生物群系修改与放置注册</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">简易原版集成工具</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">创造标签页创建与修改</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">丰富的实用工具类！\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">注册表系统</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">粒子效果</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">木材类型</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">村民交易</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">网络通信</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">配置系统</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">事件机制</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">更多功能即将推出！</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>兼容模组：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rotten-creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">腐烂生物</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/offlimits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">禁区</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cavebiomeapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">洞穴生物群系API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6H8YGoX.png\" width=\"1131\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fminecraft-servers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/H8ftf1K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1131\" height=\"283\"></a></p>",
